description: Resolve VRChat local storage layout on Windows/Linux/Quest — output logs, trace/debug logs, crash dumps, asset cache, screenshots, and config.json precedence. Use when building tooling that reads VRChat logs/cache, troubleshooting crashes, migrating cache to another drive, or generating paths/parsers from config.json.
